                                "sense_id": "d708c409-2835-3422-bf0c-969d8cadf90c",
                                "text": "[Nigel] Farage recalls: What was clear from that polling was that in June 2015 the most trusted person in the country on whether to Brexit or not to Brexit was David Cameron."
                            },
